Subject: [PATCH v13 1/8] jails/instances/lab-mail: Keep the list in INBOX
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: rlxvpnnwlozmnxnwknyksoqukkvvurxy
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:55:02 +0000

The list has a Fastmail account of its own, so nothing but list mail
arrives in it and there is nothing to sort. A Fastmail rule that
files posts into lists only adds a step between a post and its
readers, and leaves an empty INBOX beside the list on every client.

- mbsync pulls Fastmail's INBOX into the maildir's INBOX, and Dovecot
  serves that folder as INBOX.
- lab-claude pulls INBOX into the same local folder as before.
- README.org has the operator remove the old lists folder and the
  Fastmail rule.
